WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.316
Welcome to our training on the customer reviews tool.

00:00:03.316 --> 00:00:08.473
Product reviews are an important part of buying and selling in the Amazon store.

00:00:08.473 --> 00:00:12.894
They help customers understand the experiences of those who've already purchased products.

00:00:12.894 --> 00:00:16.578
And they help sellers identify and correct product and listing issues.

00:00:16.578 --> 00:00:22.472
If you're a professional seller internal to a brand enrolled in Amazon Brand Registry, you can use

00:00:22.472 --> 00:00:25.419
the customer reviews tool to track product reviews.

00:00:25.419 --> 00:00:29.840
You can also use it to respond to customers who've left reviews,

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.840
between one and three stars.

00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:35.520
Let's find out how to use the customer reviews tool

00:00:35.520 --> 00:00:39.009
and go over some basic guidelines for customer communication.

00:00:39.009 --> 00:00:40.560
If you meet the

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:45.400
requirements, you can access the customer reviews tool anytime in Seller Central

00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:49.942
by hovering over brands in the main menu, then clicking customer reviews.

00:00:49.942 --> 00:00:50.320
The

00:00:50.320 --> 00:00:55.120
customer reviews tool displays product reviews in chronological order, starting

00:00:55.120 --> 00:00:57.480
with the most recent at the top.

00:00:57.480 --> 00:00:59.840
It includes reviews for products within a

00:00:59.840 --> 00:01:03.800
brand when they're sold by you, as well as other sellers.

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:05.240
Reviews first appear in

00:01:05.240 --> 00:01:09.200
the tool within 48 hours of their publication on a product detail page,

00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:13.720
and they're retained for 90 days to help you spot trends and coordinate

00:01:13.720 --> 00:01:14.000
responses.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:18.200
You can use the series of filters at the top of the tool to find

00:01:18.200 --> 00:01:19.933
specific types of reviews.

00:01:19.933 --> 00:01:23.400
Narrow the list to reviews associated with orders

00:01:23.400 --> 00:01:27.028
you fulfilled or to orders fulfilled by other sellers.

00:01:27.028 --> 00:01:28.640
You can also filter

00:01:28.640 --> 00:01:32.480
reviews according to whether a customer has already received a response through

00:01:32.480 --> 00:01:33.931
the customer reviews tool.

00:01:33.931 --> 00:01:37.560
You can select reviews with one or more star ratings

00:01:37.560 --> 00:01:41.507
too, or you can select reviews according to their age.

00:01:41.507 --> 00:01:43.480
You can click the include

00:01:43.480 --> 00:01:47.480
marked as done filter if you want to see reviews that you previously removed from

00:01:47.480 --> 00:01:50.576
the list by checking the mark as done box.

00:01:50.576 --> 00:01:52.640
This will resurface reviews that you

00:01:52.640 --> 00:01:55.029
marked done in the last 90 days.

00:01:55.029 --> 00:01:57.760
The star rating filter can help you find

00:01:57.760 --> 00:02:00.448
customer reviews you might want to respond to.

00:02:00.448 --> 00:02:02.800
Select the 1 2 and 3 stars

00:02:02.800 --> 00:02:07.200
filters then look for contact customer and offer courtesy refund links on the

00:02:07.200 --> 00:02:08.308
right-hand side.

00:02:08.308 --> 00:02:12.000
If you click contact customer you can select courtesy refund

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:14.900
or customer support as your response type.

00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:17.800
If you click offer courtesy refund that

00:02:17.800 --> 00:02:19.923
response type will be pre-selected.

00:02:19.923 --> 00:02:22.400
You won't be able to select customer

00:02:22.400 --> 00:02:26.520
support because the customer previously opted out of communication with Amazon

00:02:26.520 --> 00:02:30.335
sellers and only courtesy refunds are now permitted.

00:02:30.335 --> 00:02:32.720
Both the courtesy refund and

00:02:32.720 --> 00:02:37.338
customer support responses that appear below are automated and uneditable.

00:02:37.338 --> 00:02:37.800
The

00:02:37.800 --> 00:02:42.440
courtesy refund message offers the customer a full refund and the customer

00:02:42.440 --> 00:02:46.840
support message asks the customer for an opportunity to address any issues or

00:02:46.840 --> 00:02:47.211
concerns.

00:02:47.211 --> 00:02:52.040
After reviewing either type of message you can click the send button to

00:02:52.040 --> 00:02:53.697
email it to the customer.

00:02:53.697 --> 00:02:56.680
If they reply you'll receive their response via the

00:02:56.680 --> 00:03:01.520
buyer seller messaging tool in seller central which you can access by clicking

00:03:01.520 --> 00:03:04.286
the envelope icon in the top right corner.

00:03:04.286 --> 00:03:06.360
While reviewing one to three star

00:03:06.360 --> 00:03:10.948
reviews you may also see a status next to a review instead of a link.

00:03:10.948 --> 00:03:11.560
That means

00:03:11.560 --> 00:03:13.189
you aren't able to respond.

00:03:13.189 --> 00:03:16.120
This could be because you aren't the seller who

00:03:16.120 --> 00:03:20.360
fulfilled the order or because the order was placed more than 12 months ago.

00:03:20.360 --> 00:03:24.800
Purchases also have to be verified in order for a seller to contact a

00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:27.992
customer and they can't be for a digital subscription.

00:03:27.992 --> 00:03:30.120
If you receive a reply from

00:03:30.120 --> 00:03:34.560
a customer in response to a message sent through the customer reviews tool it's

00:03:34.560 --> 00:03:38.360
important to keep in mind that any additional messages you send using buyer

00:03:38.360 --> 00:03:43.400
seller messaging must comply with Amazon's customer product reviews policies and

00:03:43.400 --> 00:03:44.244
community guidelines.

00:03:44.244 --> 00:03:48.040
Please review both in full before communicating with a

00:03:48.040 --> 00:03:48.391
customer.

00:03:48.391 --> 00:03:52.600
You can search for them in seller central and the Amazon store

00:03:52.600 --> 00:03:53.169
respectively.

00:03:53.169 --> 00:03:57.720
Note too that customer product reviews policies specifically

00:03:57.720 --> 00:04:02.287
prohibit sellers from asking customers to change or remove reviews.

00:04:02.287 --> 00:04:03.200
More broadly

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:07.720
they prohibit sellers from attempting to influence customer reviews ratings or

00:04:07.720 --> 00:04:08.148
feedback.

00:04:08.148 --> 00:04:13.280
While scrolling through reviews in the Amazon store you may discover one

00:04:13.280 --> 00:04:17.800
that you suspect violates the community guidelines or customer reviews policies.

00:04:17.800 --> 00:04:21.986
In that case click show review details below the review.

00:04:21.986 --> 00:04:23.660
On the public customer

00:04:23.660 --> 00:04:28.288
review page click report abuse then the report button in the pop-up.

00:04:28.288 --> 00:04:29.000
We'll remove

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:33.720
the review from the Amazon store if it violates our policies which means it

00:04:33.720 --> 00:04:37.071
will also be removed from the customer reviews tool.

00:04:37.071 --> 00:04:38.560
This concludes our training

00:04:38.560 --> 00:04:40.427
on the customer reviews tool.

00:04:40.427 --> 00:04:43.040
We encourage you to watch additional seller

00:04:43.040 --> 00:04:47.480
university videos about other tools and benefits available to brands enrolled in

00:04:47.480 --> 00:04:48.227
brand registry.

00:04:48.227 --> 00:04:51.960
You can also get more information about the eligibility to

00:04:51.960 --> 00:04:56.880
access brand selling benefits by watching videos in our course launch your brand

00:04:56.880 --> 00:04:58.849
in the Amazon store.

00:04:58.849 --> 00:05:03.280
Thank you and happy selling in the Amazon store.
